{"speciesId":134,"names":{"fr":"Aquali","es":"Vaporeon","en":"Vaporeon","ja":"シャワーズ"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"red","text":"Lives close to water. Its long tail is ridged with a fin which is often mistaken for a mermaid's."},{"language":"en","version":"blue","text":"Lives close to water. Its long tail is ridged with a fin which is often mistaken for a mermaid's."},{"language":"en","version":"yellow","text":"Its cell structure is similar to water molecules. It will melt away and become invis­ ible in water."},{"language":"en","version":"gold","text":"When VAPOREON's fins begin to vi­ brate, it is a sign that rain will come within a few hours."},{"language":"en","version":"silver","text":"It prefers beauti­ ful shores. With cells similar to water molecules, it could melt in water."},{"language":"en","version":"crystal","text":"As it uses the fins on the tip of its tail to swim, it blends with the water perfectly."},{"language":"en","version":"ruby","text":"VAPOREON underwent a spontaneous mutation and grew fins and gills that allow it to live underwater. This POKéMON has the ability to freely control water."},{"language":"en","version":"sapphire","text":"VAPOREON underwent a spontaneous mutation and grew fins and gills that allow it to live underwater. This POKéMON has the ability to freely control water."},{"language":"en","version":"emerald","text":"VAPOREON underwent a spontaneous mutation and grew fins and gills that allow them to live underwater. They have the ability to freely control water."},{"language":"en","version":"firered","text":"Its body’s cellular structure is similar to the molecular composition of water. It can melt invisibly in water."},{"language":"en","version":"leafgreen","text":"Lives close to water. Its long tail is ridged with a fin which is often mistaken for a mermaid’s."},{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"It has evolved to be suitable for an aquatic life. It can invisibly melt away into water."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"It has evolved to be suitable for an aquatic life. It can invisibly melt away into water."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"Its cell composition is similar to water molecules. As a result, it can melt away into water."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"When VAPOREON’s fins begin to vibrate, it is a sign that rain will come within a few hours."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"It prefers beautiful shores. With cells similar to water molecules, it could melt in water."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Sa composition moléculaire est proche de celle de l’eau, ce qui lui permet de se liquéfier."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"Its cell composition is similar to water molecules. As a result, it can melt away into water."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Sa composition moléculaire est proche de celle de l’eau, ce qui lui permet de se liquéfier."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"Its cell composition is similar to water molecules. As a result, it can melt away into water."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"Its cell composition is similar to water molecules. As a result, it can’t be seen when it melts away into water."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"Its cell composition is similar to water molecules. As a result, it can’t be seen when it melts away into water."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Il préfère les belles plages. Il peut se dissoudre à volonté grâce à ses cellules proches de l’eau."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Prefiere las bellas costas. Con células parecidas al agua, podría fundirse en la misma."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"It prefers beautiful shores. With cells similar to water molecules, it could melt in water."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"きれいな 水辺を 好んでいる。 細胞が 水の 分子に 似ており 水に 溶けることもできる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Il a évolué pour s’adapter au milieu aquatique. Il peut se fondre et disparaître dans l’élément liquide."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Ha evolucionado para adaptarse a la vida acuática. Se mimetiza a la perfección con el agua."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"It has evolved to be suitable for an aquatic life. It can invisibly melt away into water."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"水中での 生活に 適した 体に 進化した。 水に 溶けると 見えなくなる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Aquali a subi une mutation spontanée. Des nageoires et des branchies sont apparues sur son corps, ce qui lui permet de vivre dans les fonds marins. Ce Pokémon peut contrôler l’eau à volonté."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Vaporeon sufrió una mutación repentina y desarrolló aletas y branquias que le permiten vivir bajo el agua. Asimismo, este Pokémon tiene la habilidad de controlar las aguas."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Vaporeon underwent a spontaneous mutation and grew fins and gills that allow it to live underwater. This Pokémon has the ability to freely control water."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"突然変異に より 水中で 生活 できる ように ヒレと エラが 生えてきた。 水を 自在に 操る 力を 持つ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Aquali a subi une mutation spontanée. Des nageoires et des branchies sont apparues sur son corps, ce qui lui permet de vivre dans les fonds marins. Ce Pokémon peut contrôler l’eau à volonté."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Vaporeon sufrió una mutación repentina y desarrolló aletas y branquias que le permiten vivir bajo el agua. Asimismo, este Pokémon tiene la habilidad de controlar las aguas."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Vaporeon underwent a spontaneous mutation and grew fins and gills that allow it to live underwater. This Pokémon has the ability to freely control water."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"突然変異に より 水中で 生活 できる ように ヒレと エラが 生えてきた。 水を 自在に 操る 力を 持つ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sun","text":"La structure de ses cellules ressemble à celle des molécules d’eau. Il vit sur les rives, et il arrive qu’il soit pris pour une sirène."},{"language":"es","version":"sun","text":"Su composición celular es muy parecida a la estructura molecular del agua. Vive cerca de ríos y mares y a veces lo toman por una sirena."},{"language":"en","version":"sun","text":"Its cells are composed of units much like water molecules. It lives close to water and is often mistaken for a mermaid."},{"language":"ja","version":"sun","text":"細胞構造が 水の 分子に よく 似ている。 水辺に 棲むので 人魚に 間違われることも。"},{"language":"fr","version":"moon","text":"Ce Pokémon plonge dans l’eau et y reste caché jusqu’à ce qu’un Pokémon poisson passe à sa portée."},{"language":"es","version":"moon","text":"Se funde con el agua y se oculta por completo. Entonces espera pacientemente a que aparezca algún Pokémon pez para atraparlo."},{"language":"en","version":"moon","text":"Blending in with the water and erasing all signs of its presence, it patiently waits for its prey, fish Pokémon."},{"language":"ja","version":"moon","text":"水の中に 溶け込んで 気配を 隠し 獲物の さかなポケモンが 来るのを じっと 待ち構えている。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-sun","text":"On le trouve principalement dans les sources limpides. Lorsqu’un ennemi est sur le point de l’attaquer, il plonge se réfugier dans l’eau."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Suele habitar en cuerpos de agua cristalina. Si advierte un posible ataque enemigo, se sumerge bajo el agua para ocultarse."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Clean, clear waters are its usual habitat. When it’s about to be attacked by an invading enemy, it dives into the water to hide."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-sun","text":"綺麗な 水辺が 主な 棲み処。 外敵に 襲われそうに なると 水に 飛び込み 姿を 隠す。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Il perçoit l’humidité ambiante grâce aux ailerons de sa tête. S’ils frémissent, c’est qu’il pleuvra d’ici quelques heures."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Sus aletas detectan la humedad del ambiente. Si comienzan a vibrar, es señal de que lloverá en las próximas horas."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-moon","text":"It detects nearby moisture with its fin. When its fin begins trembling rapidly, that means rain will fall in a few hours."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-moon","text":"ヒレで まわりの 水分を 感知 している。 小刻みに 震えだすと 数時間後には 雨が 降る。"},{"language":"fr","version":"lets-go-pikachu","text":"Sa structure moléculaire est semblable à celle de l’eau. Il est invisible en milieu aquatique."},{"language":"es","version":"lets-go-pikachu","text":"Su estructura celular se parece a las moléculas de agua, por eso es invisible cuando está en este elemento."},{"language":"en","version":"lets-go-pikachu","text":"Its cell structure is similar to water molecules. It melts into the water and becomes invisible."},{"language":"ja","version":"lets-go-pikachu","text":"細胞組織が 水の 分子に 似ているため 水に 溶けると 姿が 見えなく なってしまう。"},{"language":"fr","version":"lets-go-eevee","text":"Sa structure moléculaire est semblable à celle de l’eau. Il est invisible en milieu aquatique."},{"language":"es","version":"lets-go-eevee","text":"Su estructura celular se parece a las moléculas de agua, por eso es invisible cuando está en este elemento."},{"language":"en","version":"lets-go-eevee","text":"Its cell structure is similar to water molecules. It melts into the water and becomes invisible."},{"language":"ja","version":"lets-go-eevee","text":"細胞組織が 水の 分子に 似ているため 水に 溶けると 姿が 見えなく なってしまう。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"Quand ses nageoires se mettent à vibrer, c’est le signe qu’il va pleuvoir dans les heures qui suivent."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Cuando las aletas de Vaporeon comienzan a vibrar, significa que lloverá en las próximas horas."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"When Vaporeon’s fins begin to vibrate, it is a sign that rain will come within a few hours."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"シャワーズの 全身の ひれが 小刻みに 震えはじめるのは 数時間後に 雨が降る しるし。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"Sa structure cellulaire est similaire à la composition moléculaire de l’eau. Une fois dans cet élément, il devient indétectable à l’œil nu."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"La composición celular de su cuerpo es tan similar a la estructura molecular del agua que se vuelve invisible al fundirse en ella."},{"language":"en","version":"shield","text":"Its body’s cellular structure is similar to the molecular composition of water. It can melt invisibly in water."},{"language":"ja","version":"shield","text":"体の 細胞の つくりが 水の 分子と 似ている。 水に 溶けると 見えなくなる。"},{"language":"en","version":"legends-arceus","text":"Tests show that its cells closely resemble water molecules, which perhaps explains its ability to conceal its form while submerged. I believe the origins of mermaid folklore lie with this Pokémon."}],"varieties":[{"id":134,"moves":[{"name":"pay-day","learns":[[19,"machine",0],[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"double-kick","learns":[[19,"level-up",10]]},{"name":"sand-attack","learns":[[1,"level-up",1],[2,"level-up",8],[3,"level-up",8],[4,"level-up",8],[5,"level-up",8],[6,"level-up",8],[7,"level-up",8],[8,"level-up",8],[9,"level-up",8],[10,"level-up",8],[11,"level-up",8],[12,"level-up",8],[13,"level-up",8],[14,"level-up",5],[15,"level-up",5],[16,"level-up",5],[17,"level-up",5],[18,"level-up",5],[19,"level-up",1],[19,"level-up",14],[20,"level-up",5],[23,"level-up",5],[25,"level-up",5],[28,"level-up",1],[29,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"headbutt","learns":[[3,"machine",0],[4,"machine",0],[10,"tutor",0],[19,"machine",0]]},{"name":"tackle","learns":[[1,"level-up",1],[2,"level-up",1],[3,"level-up",1],[4,"level-up",1],[5,"level-up",1],[6,"level-up",1],[7,"level-up",1],[8,"level-up",1],[9,"level-up",1],[10,"level-up",1],[11,"level-up",1],[12,"level-up",1],[13,"level-up",1],[14,"level-up",1],[15,"level-up",1],[16,"level-up",1],[17,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",1],[19,"level-up",1],[20,"level-up",1],[23,"level-up",1],[24,"level-up",1],